2. Blind spots: what the author's analysis did not consider at all.
3. Verdict on "one dial": separable or not, and by which signal in the text; if separable, name the signal and three gold cases on each side that it gets right and the gold cases it gets wrong.
Out of scope: judging, matching, UI, the question seeds' content, cost. Do not propose a second model call or a cap on statements per article.

