- **No run is live.** The three draws of `poc/config/poc-v94.json` (`research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/arms/r7-combined-v94/d1..3`: the v72 architecture with the narrowest rule, the widened quote repair, review-v74) finished at 21:27 (D266); the six draws of 18:05 (`arms/r6-one-decider-v92/d1..3`, the baseline, and `arms/r6-control-v91/d1..3`) at 19:40 (D264). Against v92, v94 reaches the judge with 21% less noise, 45% instead of 61% of links on the three revenue questions, 40% fewer quote refusals, equal judgement agreement and 9% lower cost, with core and supporting reaching flat (`e2e-funnel-r7-v94.txt`, `log.md` row 14, `design-v72.md` §10). It is the default since D267. The first prompt audit (`.claude/skills/prompt-audit`, D267/D268, `design-v72.md` §12) mapped six failure classes to contradictions and missing examples in the request; the six fixes are built as extraction v75 / `poc/config/poc-v95.json` (review-v75, role-v75, categories-v75, the figure questions' takes line in `placement.takes`) and proved on stored requests (`proof-v75-*.txt`, `design-v72.md` §13, `log.md` row 15): four of the five proved classes flip, two classes remain (23 supporting matters about other companies' figures never written; comparison-sentence quotes). One draw of poc-v95 (`arms/r8-audit-v95/d1`, D268) showed the direction: noise reaching −23%, no-home drops −50%, core reaching up, judgement agreement equal, but 19 named partnerships without a size lost because the adoption condition had been written stricter than standard 5.1 kind 2; corrected in the standard's words as extraction v76 / `poc/config/poc-v96.json`, proved on the 14 articles concerned (`proof-v76-adoption.txt`). The second prompt audit (D269, `design-v72.md` §14) traced the one large class left, 57 of 148 supporting matters never written, to a precedence contradiction between the role's walk and the check's header; the sentence-level fix v77 / `poc/config/poc-v97.json` traded noise for recall one for one and is record